# Dual-server API
<!-- 이중 서버 API -->

Local: `server.ts` + `lib/exchange-service.ts`  
Production: `api/*.ts` (Vercel)
<!-- 로컬 server.ts + lib / 배포 api/*.ts -->

Any API behavior change must be applied in **both** places. See [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).
